flowchart TB
  accTitle: Superbee system context
  accDescr {
    A human works through an AI agent host. The host invokes the locally installed Superbee CLI,
    which reads and writes a user-owned bundle. Git and GitHub may share that bundle. The npm
    registry distributes the CLI. Superbee publication captures a read-only snapshot that Portal
    turns into a public site for humans.
  }

  human["Human<br/>directs work and reviews knowledge"]
  host["AI agent host<br/>Codex, Claude, OpenCode, or another harness"]
  cli["Superbee CLI<br/>agent-facing local tool"]
  bundle[("Superbee bundle<br/>user-owned Markdown and blobs")]
  git["Git / GitHub<br/>optional sharing and review"]
  npm["npm registry<br/>CLI distribution"]
  publication["superbee/publication<br/>exact read-only snapshot"]
  portal["Superbee Portal<br/>human publication adapter"]
  site["Public documentation site<br/>inspectable bundle and Views"]

  human -->|"directs work through"| host
  host -->|"invokes structured commands"| cli
  npm -->|"distributes the installed package"| cli
  cli -->|"reads and writes"| bundle
  bundle -->|"may be shared and reviewed through"| git
  bundle -->|"is captured by"| publication
  publication -->|"is presented by"| portal
  portal -->|"publishes"| site
  human -->|"reads and inspects"| site
